00:10:39.209 --> 00:10:41.830
Get you a photo with Gary shortly, my man.

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:42.663
- Thank you so much.

00:10:42.663 --> 00:10:44.580
- [Kris] I'm gonna bring Kyle up next.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:45.500
Kyle.

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:46.560
Good morning.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:47.640
Here you are with Gary.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:48.530
Where are you from Kyle?

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.600
- I'm from the Philippines.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.433
- [Kris] Nice.

00:10:50.433 --> 00:10:51.579
- Very nice.

00:10:51.579 --> 00:10:52.627
- [Kris] What do you wanna say?

00:10:52.627 --> 00:10:53.610
- Gary, I've been
watching all your videos,

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.300
even before Instagram.
- Thank you.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.430
- So I know you lay out
all the recipes of success.

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:00.103
It's about grind, it's
about hustle, or everything.

00:11:00.103 --> 00:11:03.030
But my question is it's about the mindset

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:05.950
but the question may sound so cliche but

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.320
how do you get motivated
despite all the factors

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:09.720
that comes into your life?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:12.770
- For me it's about doing what you like.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:14.570
I really believe in that.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.919
It's funny, I get asked
about that question,

00:11:16.919 --> 00:11:19.720
how do you get motivated
and for me it's very simple.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.779
It's what I like to do.

00:11:21.779 --> 00:11:24.730
I don't even feel like
it's a thing of motivation.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:28.540
It's what I would do if I
was getting paid nothing.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.680
For me, if you love your
process, then you win.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:34.230
It's kinda like going to the gym.

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:35.610
It doesn't come natural to me.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.378
For other people, it does.

00:11:37.378 --> 00:11:39.270
And they love going to the gym

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:41.190
and so they don't think it's
hard and I think it's hard.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.746
I had to hire somebody to travel with me

00:11:42.746 --> 00:11:44.890
to get me into the gym.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.400
So for me, can you put
yourself in a position

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.180
to do something that you like.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.366
Then you'll be motivated.

00:11:50.366 --> 00:11:52.990
Most people are chasing something

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:54.458
they think has money in it.

00:11:54.458 --> 00:11:59.233
Cryptocurrency, influencer,
startups, entrepreneurship,

00:11:59.233 --> 00:12:01.960
banking back in the day,
whatever it might be.

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.180
They chase the money and then thus

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.400
it's hard to get motivated

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.850
because all they care about
is the money or the success,

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:12.078
not the nine to nine, seven to seven,

00:12:12.078 --> 00:12:13.990
nine to five of everyday.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:16.220
So for me, interacting with people,

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:18.338
talking about business, running a business

00:12:18.338 --> 00:12:20.530
is what I love to do.

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:23.290
It's why I got D's and
F's as a child in school

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.860
'cause all I wanted to do was sell stuff

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.110
and be a businessman.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:27.358
So now I just do that.

00:12:27.358 --> 00:12:30.280
Too many people think the
thing they love the most,

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:33.560
music, art, cooking,
doesn't have any money in it

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.420
'cause they don't understand
how the world actually works.

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.840
Playing video games used
to not have money in it.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.890
Now it has a tremendous
amount of money in it.

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:41.937
So I would tell you to try
to put yourself in a position

00:12:41.937 --> 00:12:44.400
to like what you're doing.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.486
Then you won't even
think about motivation.

00:12:46.486 --> 00:12:48.980
- [Kris] Nice. Love it. Well done.

