00:13:28.516 --> 00:13:30.772
It changes how it reaches...

00:13:30.772 --> 00:13:35.250
- When you run ads, it's about
not only who you're targeting

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.190
but the biggest issue right now

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.066
is people aren't making enough content.

00:13:39.066 --> 00:13:42.900
So you had an ad working
that's not working?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:46.152
You need to make new ads, lots of new ads.

00:13:46.152 --> 00:13:49.890
50 videos, 50 pictures,
you see where I'm going.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.923
Facebook works better than ever.

00:13:51.923 --> 00:13:54.510
Instagram ads work better than ever.

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:57.570
The problem is most people
have one picture or one ad

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.060
or two that work.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.430
Then they keep running
it, it stops working,

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:03.270
and they think Facebook
doesn't work anymore

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:05.596
without realizing it's the ad
that's not working anymore.

00:14:05.596 --> 00:14:07.162
Do you understand?

00:14:07.162 --> 00:14:08.810
It's as simple as that.

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:10.700
